  "body": "\n<article id=\"post-74\" class=\"post-74 page type-page status-publish hentry\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/AboutPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 1. about hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">About</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"About\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/about/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">>_ /about</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">I test everything before I write about it.</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWeb developer and Android tester - hands-on guides, tested on real hardware before publishing.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6f6a6d0ec2479e2dd49499176bcb82a27a68a6c01249913c1cd74cd69487412e?s=180&#038;d=robohash&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6f6a6d0ec2479e2dd49499176bcb82a27a68a6c01249913c1cd74cd69487412e?s=360&#038;d=robohash&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-180 photo author-gravatar' height='180' width='180' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-stats\">\n<div class=\"about-stat\"><strong>240+</strong> guides published</div>\n<div class=\"about-stat\"><strong>31</strong> devices tested on</div>\n<div class=\"about-stat\"><strong>4</strong> years writing</div>\n<div class=\"about-stat\"><strong>0</strong> sponsored posts</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. ad slot ═══ -->\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"prose about-content\">\n<p>I started this blog because most Android content online is either a repackaged press release or a YouTube script optimized for watch time, not accuracy.</p>\n<p>Every guide on this site follows the same rule: if I haven&#039;t personally tested it, on my own devices, over enough time to see whether the result holds, it doesn&#039;t get published.</p>\n<h2>What I cover</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Android</strong> - real-world usage, settings, battery, permissions, and what each update actually changes. Not app development.</li>\n<li><strong>Web development</strong> - performance optimization, WordPress engineering, caching strategies that hold under load.</li>\n<li><strong>Infrastructure</strong> - self-hosting, server configs, Redis, Nginx, and the software layer underneath both.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Everything on this site runs on the exact stack I write about: an Oracle free-tier VPS, Nginx + PHP 8.3 + Redis, with the same configs I share in every guide.</p>\n<div class=\"about-cta\">\n<p>Have something worth testing? I read every email personally.</p>\n<a href=\"%BASE%/contact/\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Get in touch &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n"
